You may use, modify, and redistribute these policies, including for commercial
applications, browser demos, and cloud-hosted inference, subject to the license.
When redistributing them, include the license and applicable notices, retain
attribution, and identify modifications as required by Apache-2.0. The policies
are provided without warranties, as described in the license.

This checkpoint license grant covers the files listed above. Other checkpoint
files in this repository are outside this grant unless separately licensed.

Third-party robot descriptions and meshes (including Unitree G1 and Go2),
dependencies, and externally downloaded motion datasets are not relicensed by
this grant. In particular, the PHP training motion bundles linked in README.md
remain subject to their upstream terms; the policy license does not grant
rights to redistribute those datasets.
